<h1 nodeId="81b285f95eea49899e32e16a28e3f5a1">1.静默期要解决的问题</h1>
<p nodeId="b48db15ed52d4264848452754c0f5ef1">规避高峰期上线规则带来的风险。</p>
<h1 nodeId="eef3c1dfc668401d9e32d89676f77753">2.如何定义高峰期</h1>
<ul nodeId="25c7db78874c462e84455ca3b46eec1f">
<li nodeId="4e1f136453a54fa883f1eefed49e24ce">各业务可自己定义时段</li>
<li nodeId="84be8680010c456195cf401dedca75d7">时间段可以是多段，如14:00 -15:00,17:00-19:00</li>
<li nodeId="d8c2a19be3f84305802322e91b144425">联系 @朱翊然 进行定制。</li>
</ul>
<p nodeId="4196cdd706f04a0a8bc06217b5b47025"><span color="rgb(255, 0, 0)">备注：高峰期对整个业务组有效。</span></p>
<h1 nodeId="b7dae5cec8e8454388f18e7abe0d786a"><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">3.哪些操作在静默期被禁止</span></h1>
<ul nodeId="4d05fb525a3541ccb4e32407cf203315">
<li nodeId="d32d5af01a2346eeada8eaf117a56534">修改规则在场景中的状态、优先级、决策（状态变更含生效改为标记、标记改为生效）</li>
<li nodeId="ce76d26532dd428da04345def34afeab">规则或因子的强制更新</li>
<li nodeId="01684e2e3c864526b641e42a27721b36">参数的任何修改</li>
</ul>
<h1 nodeId="27b1094995f54c72b22f7d357b7f354b">4.哪些操作在静默期是允许的</h1>
<ul nodeId="60c62c44ad014ac482280a039f1b78e7">
<li nodeId="943050535e614ed4ae3cade80a9b18a9">新建或修改<span color="rgb(255, 0, 0)">标记规则</span></li>
<li nodeId="9f45bfdd9fc84fd2beaf0e908543b804"><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">将</span><span color="rgb(255, 0, 0)">标记规则</span><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">配置在场景中</span></li>
<li nodeId="c039cf2ee2324551938708a67579cb4e"><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)">修改未被引用的因子</span></li>
</ul>
<h1 nodeId="ebc5ad095e6843819c92294c7b172b00">5.如何解除静默期限制</h1>
<p nodeId="8629a3ce884e4e0cbcbe37c7d4b99573">点击申请两小时解禁即可：</p>
<ul nodeId="db21b81fe5a84bcebad8349f1cdb6d56">
<li nodeId="09e10cc087144f2c880c531eda75e2e2">
<p nodeId="15da8183703c4527a5d1f7f10339a645"><span color="rgb(169, 68, 66)">当前时间段在静默期，禁止</span><a href="http://xn--dtra/" title="敏感操作" nodeId="3a76920db3f6488db60233f5a7acc75e"><span color="rgb(169, 68, 66)">敏感操作</span></a><span color="rgb(169, 68, 66)">，如有特殊情况，选择“立即申请”</span></p>
<p nodeId="4d502eac3693456885e98d32a9daef99"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/28163548/654341343?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="414" height="166" nodeId="7e5e60b3d05341bdb5fc5603b04f50c4" /><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/28163548/654341105?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="357" height="298" nodeId="48f67a907ce94f039f266c5456939be4" /></p>
</li>
</ul>
